# Assembled package (see build.sh) and this crate's own build/lock state. It
# is a separate workspace (see ../../Cargo.toml), so it carries its own lock
# file. `dist/` is generated wholesale — the sources are js/ and
# package.template.json.
/dist/
/pkg/
/target/
/Cargo.lock
# All supplied locally by whoever runs the demo; see www/index.html. The
# document and the picture are generated — `document_save` writes
# examples/document.hep and `document_placeholder` writes
# examples/document.png, and both of those are gitignored too.
/www/font.ttf
/www/document.hep
/www/document.png
